notes.notes:
We are glad you’re playing, thank you so much for your support!
We want to apologize for rushing things a bit due to time constraints, and not being able to do everything we could have.
Over the past few weeks, we’ve been reading your comments and realized there’s a big issue with optimization and text. 
So in this update, we’ve focused heavily on those two points.
We found an old laptop and managed to double the FPS on it. Disabling Nanite and Lumen helped, the image quality didn’t suffer, but performance doubled.
We will continue working on improvements and reading your comments. 

Thank you for playing!

Update list:


 optimization of textures and lighting;
 fixed the appearance of the third ending;
 added more story and explanations to the finale;
 minor UI adjustments;
 reread and corrected texts in both Russian and English;
 added a graveyard with a puzzle;
 crows now fly away;
 added a few Easter eggs (can you find them?).
